{"code":"pt-BR","name":"Portuguese","native":"Português","variant":"Brazil","badge":"PT","tts":"pt-BR","sheets":[{"id":"C1","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Keep it alive","blurb":"The lines that rescue any conversation. You’ll use these every day, everywhere.","items":[{"id":"c1.1","t":"Não entendi.","say":"nowng en-ten-JEE","en":"I don't understand.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"lit":"not I-understood"},{"id":"c1.2","t":"Não sei.","say":"nowng SAY","en":"I don't know.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.3","t":"Um momento, por favor.","say":"oong moh-MEN-too, por fah-VOR","en":"One moment, please.","ctx":["work","shops","phone"],"tags":"wait hold on sec moment"},{"id":"c1.4","t":"Pode repetir?","say":"POH-jee heh-peh-CHEER","en":"Can you say that again?","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"repeat again pardon what"},{"id":"c1.5","t":"Mais devagar, por favor.","say":"mice jee-vah-GAR, por fah-VOR","en":"Slower, please.","ctx":["travel","chat"],"tags":"slow slowly speak"},{"id":"c1.6","t":"Como se diz “…”?","say":"KOH-moo see JEES","en":"How do you say “…”?","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"word translate"}]},{"id":"C2","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"React like you belong","blurb":"Short reactions that make you sound fluent while you listen.","items":[{"id":"c2.1","t":"Claro.","say":"KLAH-roo","en":"Sure. / Of course.","ctx":["work","shops","chat"],"tags":"yes ok okay sure course"},{"id":"c2.2","t":"Exatamente.","say":"eh-zah-tah-MEN-chee","en":"Exactly. / Right.","ctx":["work","chat"],"tags":"yes right correct agree"},{"id":"c2.3","t":"Acho que sim.","say":"AH-shoo kee SEENG","en":"I think so.","ctx":["work","chat"]},{"id":"c2.4","t":"Sério?","say":"SEH-ree-oo","en":"Really?","ctx":["chat"]},{"id":"c2.5","t":"Sem problema.","say":"seng proh-BLEH-mah","en":"No problem. / No worries.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"welcome fine ok"},{"id":"c2.6","t":"Que legal!","say":"kee leh-GOW","en":"Great! / How nice!","ctx":["chat","family"],"tags":"cool awesome nice"}]},{"id":"C3","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Frames","blurb":"Phrases with a blank. Drop in any word you know and you have a new sentence.","items":[{"id":"c3.1","t":"Onde fica {x}?","say":"ON-jee FEE-kah {x}","en":"Where is {x}?","ctx":["travel","toilets"],"tags":"where find","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bathroom","fits":["place","work"]},{"id":"c3.2","t":"Eu queria {x}.","say":"eh-oo keh-REE-ah {x}","en":"I'd like {x}.","ctx":["food","shops"],"tags":"want like would order get","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"coffee","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.3","t":"Você tem {x}?","say":"voh-SEH teng {x}","en":"Do you have {x}?","ctx":["shops","food"],"tags":"have any got there","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"water","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.4","t":"{x}, por favor.","say":"{x}, por fah-VOR","en":"{x}, please.","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"please give","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bill","fits":["thing","work"]},{"id":"c3.5","t":"Tenho que {x}.","say":"TEN-yoo kee {x}","en":"I have to {x}.","ctx":["work","plans"],"tags":"must need got","frame":true,"takes":"verb","ex":"leave"},{"id":"c3.6","t":"Posso {x}?","say":"POH-soo {x}","en":"Can I {x}?","ctx":["work","travel"],"tags":"can may could allowed","frame":true,"takes":"verb","ex":"comein"}]},{"id":"W","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"work","title":"Work: Slack & meetings","blurb":"Mostly lines you already know, plus two new ones and some words for your blanks.","items":[{"id":"w.1","t":"Vou verificar.","say":"voh veh-ree-fee-KAR","en":"I'll check it.","tags":"look into get back"},{"id":"w.2","t":"Tenho uma reunião.","say":"TEN-yoo OO-mah heh-oo-nee-OWNG","en":"I have a meeting.","tags":"busy call"}],"core":["c1.3","c1.1","c1.2","c1.4","c2.1","c2.2"],"words":["meeting","file","screen","message","tomorrow"]},{"id":"T1","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Eating out","blurb":"Your frames do most of the ordering. A few new lines and some food words.","diet":true,"items":[{"id":"t1.1","t":"É apimentado?","say":"eh ah-pee-men-TAH-doo","en":"Is it spicy?","tags":"hot chili"},{"id":"t1.2","t":"Sem cebola, por favor.","say":"seng seh-BOH-lah, por fah-VOR","en":"Without onion, please."},{"id":"t1.3","t":"O que você recomenda?","say":"oo kee voh-SEH heh-koh-MEN-dah","en":"What do you recommend?"},{"id":"t1.4","t":"Eu não como carne.","say":"eh-oo nowng KOH-moo KAR-nee","en":"I don't eat meat.","tags":"vegetarian vegan meat"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.4","c3.3","c1.1"],"words":["water","coffee","bill","menu","beer","this"]},{"id":"T2","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Shopping & money","blurb":"Want, have, one moment: all core. Four new lines.","items":[{"id":"t2.1","t":"Quanto custa?","say":"KWAN-too KOOS-tah","en":"How much is it?","tags":"price cost how much"},{"id":"t2.2","t":"Só estou olhando.","say":"soh es-TOH ol-YAN-doo","en":"I'm just looking."},{"id":"t2.3","t":"Vou levar.","say":"voh leh-VAR","en":"I'll take it."},{"id":"t2.4","t":"Posso pagar com cartão?","say":"POH-soo pah-GAR kong kar-TOWNG","en":"Can I pay by card?","tags":"credit card cash pay"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.3","c1.3"],"words":["this","bag"]},{"id":"T3","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Getting around","blurb":"Ask with your core frame, then understand the answer.","items":[{"id":"t3.1","t":"É longe?","say":"eh LON-zhee","en":"Is it far?"},{"id":"t3.2","t":"Para o aeroporto, por favor.","say":"PAH-rah oo ah-eh-roh-POR-too, por fah-VOR","en":"To the airport, please. (taxi)","tags":"taxi cab driver"},{"id":"t3.3","t":"à esquerda · à direita · em frente","say":"ah es-KER-dah · ah jee-RAY-tah · eng FREN-chee","en":"left · right · straight on","hear":true,"tags":"directions"}],"core":["c3.1","c1.5","c1.4"],"words":["station","airport","hotel"]},{"id":"T4","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Toilets, help & signs","blurb":"Ask with your core frame. New: a few emergency lines and the signs you’ll see.","signs":true,"items":[{"id":"t4.1","t":"Socorro!","say":"soh-KOH-hoo","en":"Help!","tags":"emergency"},{"id":"t4.2","t":"Não tem papel higiênico.","say":"nowng teng pah-PEW ee-zhee-EH-nee-koo","en":"There's no toilet paper."},{"id":"t4.3","t":"Estou passando mal.","say":"es-TOH pah-SAN-doo MOW","en":"I feel sick.","tags":"ill unwell doctor"},{"id":"t4.4","t":"Chame uma ambulância, por favor.","say":"SHAH-mee OO-mah am-boo-LAN-see-ah","en":"Please call an ambulance.","tags":"emergency doctor"}],"core":["c3.1","c3.4","c1.1"],"words":["bathroom","pharmacy","hospital"]},{"id":"F","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"family","title":"Family & small talk","blurb":"Reactions carry the conversation. Four new lines to start one.","items":[{"id":"f.1","t":"Prazer.","say":"prah-ZEHR","en":"Nice to meet you."},{"id":"f.2","t":"De onde você é?","say":"jee ON-jee voh-SEH eh","en":"Where are you from?"},{"id":"f.3","t":"O que você faz?","say":"oo kee voh-SEH FAHS","en":"What do you do (for work)?"},{"id":"f.4","t":"Está uma delícia!","say":"es-TAH OO-mah deh-LEE-see-ah","en":"It's delicious!"}],"core":["c2.1","c2.4","c2.6","c2.3"]},{"id":"B1","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Hello & basics","blurb":"Greetings, yes and no, please and thanks.","items":[{"id":"b1.1","t":"Oi.","say":"oy","en":"Hello.","tags":"hi hey"},{"id":"b1.2","t":"Bom dia.","say":"bong JEE-ah","en":"Good morning."},{"id":"b1.3","t":"Tudo bem?","say":"TOO-doo beng","en":"How are you?"},{"id":"b1.4","t":"Sim. · Não.","say":"seeng · nowng","en":"Yes. · No."},{"id":"b1.5","t":"Por favor.","say":"por fah-VOR","en":"Please."},{"id":"b1.6","t":"Obrigado. / Obrigada.","say":"oh-bree-GAH-doo / oh-bree-GAH-dah","en":"Thank you. (men say obrigado, women obrigada)"},{"id":"b1.7","t":"Desculpa.","say":"jees-KOOL-pah","en":"Sorry. / Excuse me.","tags":"excuse me pardon apologize"},{"id":"b1.8","t":"Tchau.","say":"chow","en":"Goodbye.","tags":"bye"}]},{"id":"B2","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Numbers","blurb":"Enough for prices, times and phone numbers.","items":[{"id":"b2.1","t":"um · dois · três","say":"oong · doys · trehs","en":"1 · 2 · 3"},{"id":"b2.2","t":"quatro · cinco · seis","say":"KWAH-troo · SEEN-koo · says","en":"4 · 5 · 6"},{"id":"b2.3","t":"sete · oito · nove","say":"SEH-chee · OY-too · NOH-vee","en":"7 · 8 · 9"},{"id":"b2.4","t":"dez · vinte · cem","say":"dehs · VEEN-chee · seng","en":"10 · 20 · 100"}]},{"id":"B3","mode":"basic","kind":"blueprint","title":"Blueprint","blurb":"How the language works, on one page. Spot the pattern; skip the rulebook.","items":[{"id":"b3.1","t":"A maçã é vermelha.","say":"ah mah-SAHNG eh ver-MEL-yah","en":"The apple is red.","note":"adjective after the noun · vermelha agrees with a"},{"id":"b3.2","t":"Eu como a maçã.","say":"eh-oo KOH-moo ah mah-SAHNG","en":"I eat the apple.","note":"como = I eat · “eu” is often dropped"},{"id":"b3.3","t":"Eu comi a maçã.","say":"eh-oo koh-MEE ah mah-SAHNG","en":"I ate the apple.","note":"past is a new ending: comi"},{"id":"b3.4","t":"Eu quero comer a maçã.","say":"eh-oo KEH-roo koh-MEHR ah mah-SAHNG","en":"I want to eat the apple.","note":"helper + infinitive"},{"id":"b3.5","t":"Você come maçãs?","say":"voh-SEH KOH-mee mah-SAHNGS","en":"Do you eat apples?","note":"the voice goes up to ask"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bathroom","t":"o banheiro","say":"oo ban-YAY-roo","en":"the bathroom","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"toilet restroom washroom wc loo"},{"id":"pharmacy","t":"a farmácia","say":"ah far-MAH-see-ah","en":"the pharmacy","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"drugstore chemist medicine"},{"id":"hospital","t":"o hospital","say":"oo os-pee-TOW","en":"the hospital","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"doctor emergency"},{"id":"station","t":"a estação","say":"ah es-tah-SOWNG","en":"the station","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"train metro subway"},{"id":"airport","t":"o aeroporto","say":"oo ah-eh-roh-POR-too","en":"the airport","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"flight plane"},{"id":"hotel","t":"o hotel","say":"oo oh-TEW","en":"the hotel","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"room stay"},{"id":"water","t":"água","say":"AH-gwah","en":"water","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink"},{"id":"coffee","t":"um café","say":"oong kah-FEH","en":"a coffee","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"cafe drink"},{"id":"bill","t":"a conta","say":"ah KON-tah","en":"the bill","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"check pay receipt"},{"id":"menu","t":"o cardápio","say":"oo kar-DAH-pee-oo","en":"the menu","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"food order"},{"id":"beer","t":"uma cerveja","say":"OO-mah ser-VEH-zhah","en":"a beer","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink alcohol"},{"id":"this","t":"isso","say":"EE-soo","en":"this one","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"that one"},{"id":"bag","t":"uma sacola","say":"OO-mah sah-KOH-lah","en":"a bag","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"plastic bag"},{"id":"meeting","t":"a reunião","say":"ah heh-oo-nee-OWNG","en":"the meeting","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"call standup zoom"},{"id":"file","t":"o arquivo","say":"oo ar-KEE-voo","en":"the file","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"document doc"},{"id":"screen","t":"a tela","say":"ah TEH-lah","en":"the screen","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"share screen"},{"id":"message","t":"a mensagem","say":"ah men-SAH-zheng","en":"the message","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"slack text dm"},{"id":"tomorrow","t":"amanhã","say":"ah-man-YAHNG","en":"tomorrow","kind":"time"},{"id":"leave","t":"ir embora","say":"eer en-BOH-rah","en":"go","kind":"verb","tags":"leave go"},{"id":"comein","t":"entrar","say":"en-TRAR","en":"come in","kind":"verb","tags":"enter"},{"id":"pay","t":"pagar","say":"pah-GAR","en":"pay","kind":"verb","tags":"card cash"}],"diet":{"title":"Alergia · por favor leia","ask":"Este prato tem algum destes ingredientes?","askEn":"Does this dish contain any of these?","thanks":"Agradeço muito!","note":"","options":{"peanut":{"label":"Peanut allergy","t":"Tenho alergia grave a amendoim. Não posso comer amendoim nem óleo de amendoim.","en":"I have a severe peanut allergy. I can't eat peanuts or peanut oil."},"shellfish":{"label":"Shellfish allergy","t":"Tenho alergia grave a frutos do mar (camarão, caranguejo, mariscos).","en":"I have a severe shellfish allergy (shrimp, crab, shellfish)."},"gluten":{"label":"No gluten","t":"Não posso comer glúten (trigo, cevada, centeio).","en":"I can't eat gluten (wheat)."},"vegetarian":{"label":"No meat or fish","t":"Não como carne, frango nem peixe.","en":"I don't eat meat, chicken or fish."},"pork":{"label":"No pork","t":"Não como carne de porco.","en":"I don't eat pork."}}},"signs":[{"t":"BANHEIRO · SANITÁRIO","en":"Restrooms"},{"t":"FEMININO · MASCULINO","en":"Women · Men"},{"t":"SAÍDA · ENTRADA","en":"Exit · Entrance"},{"t":"EMPURRE · PUXE","en":"Push · Pull"},{"t":"SAÍDA DE EMERGÊNCIA","en":"Emergency exit"}]}